sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant S as Spec Skill
    participant G as Gather Skill
    participant I as Implement Skill
    participant SP as SPEC.md

    Note over U,SP: Tier 1 — During Spec (Free)
    U->>S: Change requirement
    S->>S: Update draft in conversation
    Note right of S: No file write, no record

    Note over U,SP: Tier 2 — During Gather (Lightweight)
    U->>G: amend REQ-X
    G->>SP: Increment version (v1.0 → v1.1)
    G->>SP: Append AMD-N entry
    G->>G: Re-evaluate affected decisions
    G->>U: Re-present decision table

    Note over U,SP: Tier 3 — During Implement (Impact-Assessed)
    U->>I: amend REQ-X
    I->>I: Pause execution
    I->>SP: Increment version
    I->>SP: Append AMD-N with impact analysis
    I->>U: Present 3 options
    alt Patch batch
        I->>I: Adjust current batch, continue
    else Re-gather
        I->>G: Re-run gather with amended spec
    else Story-level re-eval
        I->>S: Flag all REQs under story
    end
